(P/'README.txt').write_text('Reproduction source and frozen evidence\n\n44 Sol6.1high tool-free calls: 19 main refs +19 forecasts,3 K refs +3 forecasts. Audit records preserve exact prompts, outputs, model metadata and image hashes. Forecasts contain no images, names or future labels. References were frozen before forecasts within each stratum.\n\nRun scripts from the original workspace root with existing local clip/prefix files and installed Python/cv2/PIL. subtype_study.py imports causal_v2.py call helper, which invokes authenticated Codex CLI. No model is trained. Source deliberately stops new call launches after 2026-10-02 14:22UTC; changing this deadline and rerunning makes a NEW experiment, not a byte-identical replay. Preserve current frozen outputs.\n\nsubtype_report.py regenerates sensitivity scores and this UI from frozen outputs without model calls. It preserves original references/scores; five selected H/G native reviews affect ground_strike_attempt only.\n\nRelative links in evidence sampling manifests identify original sources; original videos remain elsewhere in this workspace. Full model calls and frames are supplied in audit/ and evidence/. extension_K has its own independent freeze/protocol and one selected overlapping episode. Hash verification in verification.json and report_verification.json. No human-gold, independent-window or calibrated-accuracy claim.\n')
